msgstr "Chests opened: %(count)"

msgid "common/statistics/tooltip/body"
msgstr ""
"Here you can view the items you received from chests during the event. You "
"can manually reset these statistics at any time."

msgid "confirmResetLootBoxStatistics/description"
msgstr "All information on opened chests will be deleted."

msgid "entryPoint/boxes"
msgstr "TO CHESTS"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special chests containing new and unique items, including Premium "
"vehicles, Free XP, 3D attachments, and more."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/title"
msgstr "Emerald Chests and How to Receive Them"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningDescription"
msgstr ""
"Chests cannot currently be opened or purchased due to technical reasons. We "
"apologize for the temporary inconvenience."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningTitle"
msgstr "Chests Temporarily Unavailable"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "Paint It GREEN!"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "PAINT IT GREEN!"

msgid "hasBoxesView/purchaseButtonText"
msgstr "GET CHESTS"

msgid "hasBoxesView/purchaseButtonTextCn"
msgstr "GET CHESTS"

msgid "hasBoxesView/quantityTitle/boxesAvailable"
msgstr "Chests available: %(boxesCount)"

msgid "hasBoxesView/quantityTitle/noBoxes"
msgstr "No boxes available"

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/autoOpen"
msgstr ""
"If you do not open chests before end of event, they will be opened "
"automatically."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all vehicles from the list of possible chest contents, "
"then all subsequent vehicles you receive from chests will be compensated in "
"gold equal to their full value."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s chests are guaranteed to contain a Tier VIII–IX "
"vehicle. If you open them without one dropping such a vehicle, then a Tier "
"VIII–IX vehicle you do not already own will drop when you open the "
"%(guaranteed0)sth chest. When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "infoPage/header/description"
msgstr ""
"Open the chest for the chance to receive valuable in-game items! See more "
"details below."

msgid "infoPage/header/shopButton"
msgstr "Get Chests"

msgid "infoPage/header/shopButtonCn"
msgstr "Get Chests"

msgid "multipleRewardView/header/subTitle/"
msgstr "From the %(name) (%(boxesCount) chests opened)"

msgid "noBoxesView/buyBoxesButtonText/"
msgstr "Get Chests"

msgid "noBoxesView/buyBoxesButtonTextCn/"
msgstr "Get Chests"

msgid "noBoxesView/description/"
msgstr ""
"You do not have any chests. You can purchase them\n"
"in the in-game Store or the Premium Shop."

msgid "noBoxesView/descriptionCn/"
msgstr ""
"You do not have any chests.\n"
"You can get them in the Premium Shop."

msgid "preview/backLabel"
msgstr "TO CHESTS"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/finish/text"
msgstr ""
"All remaining chests will be opened. Their contents will be added to your "
"account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxDefault"
msgstr "Emerald Chest"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/count"
msgstr "Chests opened: %(boxes)s"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/header"
msgstr "Remaining Chests Opened"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/text"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the event, we opened all of your chests and added their "
"contents to your account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesDisabled/header"
msgstr "Chest Opening Suspended"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesDisabled/text"
msgstr ""
"Operations with chests are temporarily unavailable due to maintenance."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesEnabled/header"
msgstr "Chest Opening Available"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesEnabled/text"
msgstr "Operations with chests are available again. Open them!"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/multipleOpen"
msgstr "Chests opened!"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/server_error"
msgstr "Chest Not Opened"

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/description/"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all vehicles from the list of possible chest contents, "
"then all subsequent vehicles you receive from chests will be compensated in "
"gold."

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/remainingCount"
msgid_plural "plural/singleRewardView/tooltip/remainingCount"
msgstr[0] "%(remainingCount) chest"
msgstr[1] "%(remainingCount) chests"
msgstr[2] "%(remainingCount) chests"

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/subtitle/"
msgstr ""
"The Guaranteed Reward is a vehicle from the list of possible chest contents.\n"
"If you open %(remainingCount) without one dropping such a vehicle, it will drop when you open the %(count) chest. When it does, the counter is reset."
